artifact MY-SRC:
    id is string as "{atype}/{num}"
    attribute title-name is mandatory string if anchor
    attribute desc is optional string if not anchor
    attribute active is mandatory boolean [true: "Yes", false: "No"]

artifact REQ:
    id is string as "{atype}/{num:5}"
    attribute contents is mandatory string
    attribute tags is optional multiple string
    attribute parent is optional reference to parent if not anchor

trace from MY-SRC to REQ is mandatory if anchor
trace from MY-SRC to REQ or OTHER is optional if not anchor
trace from TEST to REQ or MY-SRC is mandatory via commit if anchor
